      "url": "https://content-files.shure.com/Pubs/PSM300/PSM300_Spec_Sheet.pdf",
      "note": "Shure PSM 300 spec sheet (read as text on 2026-11-12): P3T half-rack transmitter 43 x 198 x 172 mm (H x W x D), 783 g, 12-15 V DC external supply; rear-panel balanced inputs and loop outputs on 6.35 mm (1/4 in) TRS, a detachable antenna, front-panel controls with an input level knob and a one-touch sync. The sheet gives the connector types and the rear panel, not the count: two inputs and two loop outputs (the stereo L and R pair) follow the knowledge base (P3T audio inputs and loop outputs, 2 each), so portsDocumented is set. The antenna (BNC) and DC input have no catalogue signal type and are drawn on the picture only (no port). The P3R body-pack in the same record is a separate device. Port and control positions are GUESSES (no panel drawing read)."
    },
